# Misc
_data/

# Runtime logs (including the optional JSONL audit sink)
**/[lL][oO][gG][sS]/
**/*.[lL][oO][gG]
**/*.[lL][oO][gG].*
**/*.[lL][oO][gG]-*
**/*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN][lL]
**/*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN][lL].*
**/*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN][lL]-*
**/*.[nN][dD][jJ][sS][oO][nN]
**/*.[nN][dD][jJ][sS][oO][nN].*
**/*.[nN][dD][jJ][sS][oO][nN]-*

# Local environment files
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Local agent and SSH metadata
**/.claude/
**/.hermes/
**/.ssh/

# Conventional private-key basenames
**/id_rsa
**/id_dsa
**/id_ecdsa
**/id_ed25519

# Private-key and certificate-container extensions
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.ppk
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore

# Temp
TEMP.md
TMP.md
temp/

